{'symbol': 'BKNG', 'date': '2022-07-26 10:35:00', 'title': 'MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL NAMES OPENTABLE AS A PREFERRED RESTAURANT TECHNOLOGY PROVIDER', 'text': 'AGREEMENT BRINGS TOGETHER GLOBAL LEADERS IN RESTAURANT TECHNOLOGY AND HOSPITALITY SAN FRANCISCO , JULY 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- OPENTABLE, PART OF BOOKING HOLDINGS, SIGNED A GLOBAL AGREEMENT TO BECOME A PREFERRED RESTAURANT TECHNOLOGY PROVIDER TO MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL. CURRENTLY, OPENTABLE SERVES MORE THAN 1,400 RESTAURANTS OPERATED BY MARRIOTT HOTELS IN PROPERTIES ACROSS 56 COUNTRIES THROUGHOUT THE WORLD.'}